`phoenix_core_components.ex` is a verbatim copy of the component module the
Phoenix project generator writes into every new application, used unmodified as
a fixture by the benchmark showcase. It is here because its `~H` sigils nest
HEEx inside Elixir and Elixir back inside HEEx.

Source:
https://github.com/phoenixframework/phoenix/blob/1562adca2e9b02b4564c519d5cc2a096ae6fc009/installer/templates/phx_web/components/core_components.ex

The MIT licence requires this notice to travel with the copy.

